  {
   "id": "takeaways",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 48,
   "y": 3370,
   "width": 1078.5600000000002,
   "height": 112.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame-ui",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1076794951,
   "version": 3,
   "versionNonce": 1571769014,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790467200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. Three Spaces: Design Goal (the design task, once), Design (one card per design), Delivery (what passed).\n2. Every card shares the goal, so a card says only what is its own.\n3. An SMS shows as the text the patient gets, with its length out of 140.\n4. Rerun and Revise start a new run; an earlier draft is never overwritten.\n5. Insight sits in each card's Rationale and Supporting work; nothing is edited in Delivery.",
   "originalText": "1. Three Spaces: Design Goal (the design task, once), Design (one card per design), Delivery (what passed).\n2. Every card shares the goal, so a card says only what is its own.\n3. An SMS shows as the text the patient gets, with its length out of 140.\n4. Rerun and Revise start a new run; an earlier draft is never overwritten.\n5. Insight sits in each card's Rationale and Supporting work; nothing is edited in Delivery.",
   "fontSize": 18,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "index": "b1q"
  },
