   "updated": 1790467200000,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. One working file, the register: goal, evidence and rules, never state.\n2. State is read from the runs; rdNN counts across the folder, not per item.\n3. A draft is results/<run>/content/sms.txt; a revise is a new run beside it.\n4. Each evidence line names its use: handoff (signed advice), evidence or avoid.",
   "originalText": "1. One working file, the register: goal, evidence and rules, never state.\n2. State is read from the runs; rdNN counts across the folder, not per item.\n3. A draft is results/<run>/content/sms.txt; a revise is a new run beside it.\n4. Each evidence line names its use: handoff (signed advice), evidence or avoid.",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
