   "text": "DESIGN MOVE\nSalience plus one honest line\noffering a savings check\na new design · built on evidence\n\n▸ Insight Evidence · 4 pages\n   Wisdom       What to explore · signed\n   Knowledge    No generative rule · avoid\n   Information  Funnel fundamentals",
