   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "column                         says                                          read from\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nDesign                         number, title, state, the SMS with {LINK}     ## ITEM06 · results/<run>/content/sms.txt\nRationale                      the design move, its Insight Evidence (the       goal:  evidence: lines\n                               insight pages), its own Design Runs      runs/rdNN_*.yaml\nEvaluation                     acceptance checks now; expected effect at     checks.yaml · review.md\n                               the send, against the Design Goal baseline    expected: falsified: · Baseline\n\nThe aim is not a column: every card shares it, and the Design Goal Space states it in full.\nA design with no named rule shows no rule line; it is never shown as an error.",
   "originalText": "column                         says                                          read from\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nDesign                         number, title, state, the SMS with {LINK}     ## ITEM06 · results/<run>/content/sms.txt\nRationale                      the design move, its Insight Evidence (the       goal:  evidence: lines\n                               insight pages), its own Design Runs      runs/rdNN_*.yaml\nEvaluation                     acceptance checks now; expected effect at     checks.yaml · review.md\n                               the send, against the Design Goal baseline    expected: falsified: · Baseline\n\nThe aim is not a column: every card shares it, and the Design Goal Space states it in full.\nA design with no named rule shows no rule line; it is never shown as an error.",
   "fontSize": 14,
