  {
   "id": "ipo-body",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 4578.0,
   "y": 254,
   "width": 477.0,
   "height": 450.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame-dt",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1221310797,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 453172717,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790826922400,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "INPUT\nAim          the value wanted, for whom\nConstraints  what every design must keep\nResources    knowledge, data, theory, past designs,\n             budget (arms, time, people)\n\nPROCESS\n1 Frame      name the principle that should create\n             the value\n2 Generate   new options from that principle, not\n             picked from a list; one variable each\n3 Predict    the expected effect, before any test\n             (expected / wrong if)\n4 Check      constraints and quality, judged by a\n             fresh reviewer\n5 Choose     a set that spans the variables\n6 Test       cheap, built to tell the options apart\n\nOUTPUT\nArtifact     the design itself\nRationale    frame, theory, rule\nBet          what should happen, and when it is wrong\nTest plan    what the test will decide\nKnowledge    the result, back into Resources  ↺",
   "originalText": "INPUT\nAim          the value wanted, for whom\nConstraints  what every design must keep\nResources    knowledge, data, theory, past designs,\n             budget (arms, time, people)\n\nPROCESS\n1 Frame      name the principle that should create\n             the value\n2 Generate   new options from that principle, not\n             picked from a list; one variable each\n3 Predict    the expected effect, before any test\n             (expected / wrong if)\n4 Check      constraints and quality, judged by a\n             fresh reviewer\n5 Choose     a set that spans the variables\n6 Test       cheap, built to tell the options apart\n\nOUTPUT\nArtifact     the design itself\nRationale    frame, theory, rule\nBet          what should happen, and when it is wrong\nTest plan    what the test will decide\nKnowledge    the result, back into Resources  ↺",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "id": "ipo-foot",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 4578.0,
   "y": 820,
   "width": 528.6400000000001,
   "height": 40.0,
   "angle": 0,
