   "updated": 1790826922400,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "theory           workbench                                   in the SMS board\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nAim              board: Design Tasks · page: Design Goal       all patients · prescription review · SMS · 6 designs\nConstraints      the design task's 'every design keeps'      ≤ 140 with the opt-out · {NAME} · no health detail\nResources        Theory of Design · Supporting work          design theory, message theories, FW02 · W2\n1 Frame          a card's Rationale (because)                'no sender named · messenger effect'\n2 Generate       Runs › Generate                             Design 3: no sender named at all\n3 Predict        a card's Expectation                        expected: fewer click · wrong if: it matches salience\n4 Check          Runs › Verify                               every rule · independent review\n5 Choose         page Delivery                               one arm per variable + salience as control\n6 Test           the send (outside the workbench)            the round-2 send\nKnowledge ↺      the next Insight board                      'did naming no sender change click?'  prior = the bet",
   "originalText": "theory           workbench                                   in the SMS board\n─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nAim              board: Design Tasks · page: Design Goal       all patients · prescription review · SMS · 6 designs\nConstraints      the design task's 'every design keeps'      ≤ 140 with the opt-out · {NAME} · no health detail\nResources        Theory of Design · Supporting work          design theory, message theories, FW02 · W2\n1 Frame          a card's Rationale (because)                'no sender named · messenger effect'\n2 Generate       Runs › Generate                             Design 3: no sender named at all\n3 Predict        a card's Expectation                        expected: fewer click · wrong if: it matches salience\n4 Check          Runs › Verify                               every rule · independent review\n5 Choose         page Delivery                               one arm per variable + salience as control\n6 Test           the send (outside the workbench)            the round-2 send\nKnowledge ↺      the next Insight board                      'did naming no sender change click?'  prior = the bet",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
