   "locked": false,
   "text": "## ITEM03 · No sender named at all\nchanges: sender\ntheory: messenger effect · Hovland & Weiss 1951\nbecause: FW02 · W2\nexpected: without a named sender fewer patients click\nfalsified: it matches salience on click and on authentication",
   "originalText": "## ITEM03 · No sender named at all\nchanges: sender\ntheory: messenger effect · Hovland & Weiss 1951\nbecause: FW02 · W2\nexpected: without a named sender fewer patients click\nfalsified: it matches salience on click and on authentication",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 3,
