   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Goal Space      →  the Folder bar: the ask, its counts, the Insight board\nDesign Space    →  Design Space, with its runs beside the cards\nInsight Space   →  Insight Space, with its runs beside the pages\nRun Space       →  each Space's Runs panel, and All runs (Folder)\nDelivery Space  →  Delivery Space, still read only",
   "originalText": "Goal Space      →  the Folder bar: the ask, its counts, the Insight board\nDesign Space    →  Design Space, with its runs beside the cards\nInsight Space   →  Insight Space, with its runs beside the pages\nRun Space       →  each Space's Runs panel, and All runs (Folder)\nDelivery Space  →  Delivery Space, still read only",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
