   "text": "# Log in with the date of birth · Design Items\n## ITEM10 · A date of birth that cannot be mistyped\ntype: ui-card · audience: all patients\njob: log in with the date of birth\ngoal: month by name, day and year as three labelled controls\nstance: explore · basis: evidence-informed\nexpected: more clickers authenticate than under ITEM07\nfalsified: at or below ITEM07, intervals overlapping\nevidence:\n- evidence · …/FD03-funnel-counts/FD03-funnel-counts.md\n- evidence · ../../0-BR-brief/BR00-brief/BR00-brief.md\nacceptance:\n- three separate labelled controls: month, day, and year\n- keeps the button label 'View Prescriptions'\n- fits 390 x 844 with no scrolling, judged on the render",
   "originalText": "# Log in with the date of birth · Design Items\n## ITEM10 · A date of birth that cannot be mistyped\ntype: ui-card · audience: all patients\njob: log in with the date of birth\ngoal: month by name, day and year as three labelled controls\nstance: explore · basis: evidence-informed\nexpected: more clickers authenticate than under ITEM07\nfalsified: at or below ITEM07, intervals overlapping\nevidence:\n- evidence · …/FD03-funnel-counts/FD03-funnel-counts.md\n- evidence · ../../0-BR-brief/BR00-brief/BR00-brief.md\nacceptance:\n- three separate labelled controls: month, day, and year\n- keeps the button label 'View Prescriptions'\n- fits 390 x 844 with no scrolling, judged on the render",
