   "text": "▸ ITEM10 · A date of birth that cannot be mistyped  ready ✓\n▸ ITEM11 · …                                        generated · waiting on you · queue the review\n▸ ITEM12 · …                                        generating · waiting on agent",
   "originalText": "▸ ITEM10 · A date of birth that cannot be mistyped  ready ✓\n▸ ITEM11 · …                                        generated · waiting on you · queue the review\n▸ ITEM12 · …                                        generating · waiting on agent",
