   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. New prescription details from\n   your visit require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\n\n2  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. One more step for your new\n   prescription. The details require your review: Reply STOP to\n   opt-out\n\n3  Hi, new prescription details require your review: Reply STOP\n   to opt-out\n\n4  Hi, Dr. {NAME} wrote you a new prescription. The details\n   require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\n\n5  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. For privacy, you'll confirm it's\n   you. New prescription details require your review: Reply STOP\n   to opt-out\n\n6  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. You can check for savings on\n   your new prescription. The details require your review: Reply\n   STOP to opt-out",
   "originalText": "1  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. New prescription details from\n   your visit require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\n\n2  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. One more step for your new\n   prescription. The details require your review: Reply STOP to\n   opt-out\n\n3  Hi, new prescription details require your review: Reply STOP\n   to opt-out\n\n4  Hi, Dr. {NAME} wrote you a new prescription. The details\n   require your review: Reply STOP to opt-out\n\n5  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. For privacy, you'll confirm it's\n   you. New prescription details require your review: Reply STOP\n   to opt-out\n\n6  Hi, it's Dr. {NAME}'s office. You can check for savings on\n   your new prescription. The details require your review: Reply\n   STOP to opt-out",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
