   "updated": 1790857063029,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "theory                variable it moves   source\nSalience              the lead            Taylor & Fiske 1978\nMessenger effect      the sender          Hovland & Weiss 1951\nExpectedness          the context         practice, not a theory\nGoal gradient         the frame           Hull 1932\nEase / friction       the next step       Thaler & Sunstein 2008\nProcessing fluency    words · length      Alter & Oppenheimer 2009\nDefaults              the ask             Johnson & Goldstein 2003\nReason (because)      the reason          Langer et al. 1978\nGain / loss framing   the frame           Tversky & Kahneman 1981\nSocial norms          social proof        Cialdini 2003\nImplementation int.   the ask             Gollwitzer 1999\nTimeliness            timing              BIT 2014\nEmotion · future self the frame           Slovic 2007 · Hershfield 2011\n\nA theory helps a design only when the design changes\nthe one variable it names, against salience.",
   "originalText": "theory                variable it moves   source\nSalience              the lead            Taylor & Fiske 1978\nMessenger effect      the sender          Hovland & Weiss 1951\nExpectedness          the context         practice, not a theory\nGoal gradient         the frame           Hull 1932\nEase / friction       the next step       Thaler & Sunstein 2008\nProcessing fluency    words · length      Alter & Oppenheimer 2009\nDefaults              the ask             Johnson & Goldstein 2003\nReason (because)      the reason          Langer et al. 1978\nGain / loss framing   the frame           Tversky & Kahneman 1981\nSocial norms          social proof        Cialdini 2003\nImplementation int.   the ask             Gollwitzer 1999\nTimeliness            timing              BIT 2014\nEmotion · future self the frame           Slovic 2007 · Hershfield 2011\n\nA theory helps a design only when the design changes\nthe one variable it names, against salience.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
