   "text": "level   Space              view (subspace)        run type            skill now\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nBoard   Design Tasks       (none: one list)       New design tasks    haipipe-design-brief\nBoard   Theory of Design   (none: one page)       Domain knowledge    haipipe-discovery\nPage    Design Goal        (none: one table)      New design          haipipe-design-workflow\nPage    Design             (none: the cards)      Commission          haipipe-design-workflow\nPage    Design             (none: the cards)      Generate            haipipe-design-unit\nPage    Design             (none: the cards)      Verify              haipipe-design-unit\nPage    Delivery           (none: text or         Passed review       haipipe-design-unit\n                            gallery by venue)\n\nNo Space has views yet, and the run types are written in design.py (_PANEL_TYPES), not in a run-cards file.",
   "originalText": "level   Space              view (subspace)        run type            skill now\n──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nBoard   Design Tasks       (none: one list)       New design tasks    haipipe-design-brief\nBoard   Theory of Design   (none: one page)       Domain knowledge    haipipe-discovery\nPage    Design Goal        (none: one table)      New design          haipipe-design-workflow\nPage    Design             (none: the cards)      Commission          haipipe-design-workflow\nPage    Design             (none: the cards)      Generate            haipipe-design-unit\nPage    Design             (none: the cards)      Verify              haipipe-design-unit\nPage    Delivery           (none: text or         Passed review       haipipe-design-unit\n                            gallery by venue)\n\nNo Space has views yet, and the run types are written in design.py (_PANEL_TYPES), not in a run-cards file.",
