  {
   "id": "sv-new",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3394.0,
   "y": 4436,
   "width": 1335.6,
   "height": 437.5,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": "frame-sv",
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 881209227,
   "version": 6,
   "versionNonce": 1037585194,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1790826922400,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Level   Space              View            Run type                Agent                                  Skill                             Person signs\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nboard   Design Tasks       Task list       Add design tasks        haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-brief              the task list\n                           Shared rules    Set shared rules        haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-brief              the rules\nboard   Theory of Design   Design theory   none                    none                                   none                              none\n                           Domain          Add a theory            haipipe-discovery-orchestrator-agent   haipipe-design-theory (new)       the source check\n─── INPUT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\npage    Design Goal        Aim             Frame the aim           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               the aim\n                           Venue           Pin the venue           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               none\n                           Rules           Set the rules           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               the rules\n                           Resources       Gather resources        haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               none\n                           Leave out       Set what to leave out   haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               the rules\n─── PROCESS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\npage    Design             Variables       Map variables           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-frame (new)        none\n                           Cards           Add a design            haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-frame (new)        none\n                           Cards           Commission              haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-commission (new)   release or hold\n                           Cards           Generate                haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-unit               none\n                           Cards           Verify                  haipipe-design-reviewer-agent (new)    haipipe-design-unit               none\n─── OUTPUT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\npage    Delivery           Designs         Passed review           haipipe-design-reviewer-agent (new)    haipipe-design-unit               none\n                           Test plan       Plan the test           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-testplan (new)     the test plan\n\nEvery run has an agent. The designer agent makes; the reviewer agent judges and never sees its own work.\nThe person signs only what is theirs: the aim, the rules, release or hold, the test plan. An agent may prepare each one.\nSource: skills/design/haipipe-workbench-design/ref/workbench-table.md (table-workbench). Cards: haipipe-design-workflow/references/run-cards.md.",
   "originalText": "Level   Space              View            Run type                Agent                                  Skill                             Person signs\n───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\nboard   Design Tasks       Task list       Add design tasks        haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-brief              the task list\n                           Shared rules    Set shared rules        haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-brief              the rules\nboard   Theory of Design   Design theory   none                    none                                   none                              none\n                           Domain          Add a theory            haipipe-discovery-orchestrator-agent   haipipe-design-theory (new)       the source check\n─── INPUT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\npage    Design Goal        Aim             Frame the aim           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               the aim\n                           Venue           Pin the venue           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               none\n                           Rules           Set the rules           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               the rules\n                           Resources       Gather resources        haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               none\n                           Leave out       Set what to leave out   haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-goal               the rules\n─── PROCESS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\npage    Design             Variables       Map variables           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-frame (new)        none\n                           Cards           Add a design            haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-frame (new)        none\n                           Cards           Commission              haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-commission (new)   release or hold\n                           Cards           Generate                haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-unit               none\n                           Cards           Verify                  haipipe-design-reviewer-agent (new)    haipipe-design-unit               none\n─── OUTPUT ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\npage    Delivery           Designs         Passed review           haipipe-design-reviewer-agent (new)    haipipe-design-unit               none\n                           Test plan       Plan the test           haipipe-designer-agent                 haipipe-design-testplan (new)     the test plan\n\nEvery run has an agent. The designer agent makes; the reviewer agent judges and never sees its own work.\nThe person signs only what is theirs: the aim, the rules, release or hold, the test plan. An agent may prepare each one.\nSource: skills/design/haipipe-workbench-design/ref/workbench-table.md (table-workbench). Cards: haipipe-design-workflow/references/run-cards.md.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
