   "updated": 1790826922400,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Why an agent on every run\n1. The skill is how the work is done; the agent is who does it, with one owner and one receipt per Run.\n2. Two design agents: haipipe-designer-agent (exists) makes, haipipe-design-reviewer-agent (new) verifies.\n3. Built: haipipe-design-goal (the five Design Goal views). Still to build: theory, frame, commission, testplan, the reviewer agent.",
   "originalText": "Why an agent on every run\n1. The skill is how the work is done; the agent is who does it, with one owner and one receipt per Run.\n2. Two design agents: haipipe-designer-agent (exists) makes, haipipe-design-reviewer-agent (new) verifies.\n3. Built: haipipe-design-goal (the five Design Goal views). Still to build: theory, frame, commission, testplan, the reviewer agent.",
   "fontSize": 15,
   "fontFamily": 8,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "autoResize": true,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
