   "text": "Item             Specification\nObjective        Increase the share of patients who\n                 open and review their new prescription\nPatient task     Review a new prescription\nContext          Just had a visit; the office texts\n                 to ask for a review\nTarget audience  All patients (444,691 invitations)\nSuccess metrics  Click-through (primary); identity\n                 verification, redemption (secondary)\nBaseline         Round-1 salience · 66.06% click-through\nDeliverables     6 requested · 6 registered · 6 ready",
   "originalText": "Item             Specification\nObjective        Increase the share of patients who\n                 open and review their new prescription\nPatient task     Review a new prescription\nContext          Just had a visit; the office texts\n                 to ask for a review\nTarget audience  All patients (444,691 invitations)\nSuccess metrics  Click-through (primary); identity\n                 verification, redemption (secondary)\nBaseline         Round-1 salience · 66.06% click-through\nDeliverables     6 requested · 6 registered · 6 ready",
