   "text": "Requirement      This task            SMS standard\nLength           ≤ 140 incl. opt-out;  160 per segment\n                 {LINK} not counted\nCall to action   The review link      Exactly one\nOpt-out          'Reply STOP to       STOP keyword\n                 opt-out', verbatim\nPersonalization  {NAME} only          Patient, medication\nLink             {LINK} after the     Short URL ≤ 30\n                 call-to-action colon\nReading level    Plain, 6th grade     Plain, 6th grade",
   "originalText": "Requirement      This task            SMS standard\nLength           ≤ 140 incl. opt-out;  160 per segment\n                 {LINK} not counted\nCall to action   The review link      Exactly one\nOpt-out          'Reply STOP to       STOP keyword\n                 opt-out', verbatim\nPersonalization  {NAME} only          Patient, medication\nLink             {LINK} after the     Short URL ≤ 30\n                 call-to-action colon\nReading level    Plain, 6th grade     Plain, 6th grade",
