   "text": "▸ Acceptance · 6 of 6 pass · independent review\n▸ Review notes\n▾ Expected effect · not tested yet, judged at the send\n  Expected  a money reason beats\n            salience on click, sign-in\n  Wrong if  it trails salience\n  Against   round-1 salience, 66.06%\n  Measured  click-through, then\n            identity verification",
